      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Omental torsion is an infrecuent cause of acute abdomen. It is related to obesity, abdominal surgery and abdominal trauma. Urgent exploratory laparotomy allows diagnosis and prevents complications as intrabdominal abcess. We present CT imaging of a Omenat torsion clinical case."},
